GoldLink's change to melonDS (UC13): only sprite-sized objects are attached.

Patch 0022 attaches the objects that stay put on screen while the camera moves (the player, a
follower, a mount, a shadow). Dark Cave's darkness, a ring of soft-edged polygons round the
player as big as the picture, stays put too: drawn in the attached picture it blacked the cave
out but for the player's sprite (the user's play test). Each object's extent on screen is kept as
its vertices come (MidTrackVertex), and one wider or taller than AttachMaxSize (72 pixels) isn't
attached (MidClassify).

Applied by build.rs to a copy of the submodule (which stays at upstream).

